<section class="section white"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Why this company exists</p><h2>The contractor experience was broken. We built a better operating system.</h2><p>Homeowners were getting ghosted mid-project. Verbal quotes turned into surprise invoices. Timelines meant nothing. Quality checks only happened when the homeowner caught something wrong.</p><p>Mid City Home Restoration was built to work differently. Every project follows a documented process. Every scope is written before work begins. Every stage gets photo-verified. Every project closes through a formal quality gate—not a disappearing act.</p><p>This is not a company built on volume. It is built on doing the work correctly, documenting it, and standing behind it. Mid City Home Restoration operates as a division of URD Management Inc., based in Lockport, New York.</p></div><img class="rounded-image" src="/assets/images/renovation-hero.jpg" alt="Mid City Home Restoration project planning"></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">The team</p><h2>Lean by design. Accountable by default.</h2><p>A small team means every person on the project understands the written scope, the quality standard, and who owns each next step.</p></div><div class="team-grid">
